msgid "fig tree"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "fig tree"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is Ficus carica, a species of small tree in the flowering plant "
"family Moraceae, native to the Mediterranean region, together with western "
"and southern Asia.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could "
"probably find a few mature ones in autumn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "fig tree"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is Ficus carica, a species of small tree in the flowering plant "
"family Moraceae, native to the Mediterranean region, together with western "
"and southern Asia.  There do not appear to be any ripe apples now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "fig tree"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is Punica granatum is a fruit-bearing deciduous shrub in the family"
" Lythraceae, subfamily Punicoideae, that grows between 5 and 10 m (16 and 33 "
"ft) tall.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably find"
" a few mature ones in autumn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "fig tree"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
