"This tree is Punica granatum is a fruit-bearing deciduous shrub in the family"
" Lythraceae, subfamily Punicoideae, that grows between 5 and 10 m (16 and 33 "
"ft) tall.  There do not appear to be any ripe apples now."
msgstr ""

