#. ~ Description of "life extension potion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
msgid ""
"A source of considerable wealth for the few alchemists talented enough to "
"distill them, these potions are capable of adding decades to the lifespan of "
"those who can afford the price of the rare and expensive ingredients they "
"require.  They are however not able to prolong a life indefinitely beyond its"
" natural years, and you will need to find other means to achieve immortality,"
" if that is your goal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "extend_life"
#. ~ Message of spell "extend_life ( Extend Life )"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/item_spells.json
msgid ""
"You imbibed the concoction and you feel your chakras align and your DNA de-"
"age."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "extend_life"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/alchemy.json
msgid ""
"This was a very valuable elixir that you just wasted drinking yourself.  You "
"can't become more unaging."
msgstr ""

